              "fill": "#a3a7ba",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "Overflow is one free-text field saved with the document, not a list of cards. Stash text into it, edit it freely, and move blocks back to the page with Ctrl+Enter or by dragging a block's grip.",
