                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1140,
                  "content": "260px panel on the right with an italic title and a multi-line field. Blocks are runs of non-blank lines; hovering a block shows its ⠿ grip. Ctrl+Enter moves the block (or selection) at the cursor to the page cursor; Ctrl+Shift+Enter copies it. The scratchpad has its own undo and never takes part in page undo.",
