              "fill": "#a3a7ba",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "A calm, keyboard-first writing app for playing with your words: keep alternatives inline, ghost passages to judge a paragraph without them, stash text on the side, and ask a model for options or cuts without ever letting it rewrite. Built in Rust with GPUI. Reference window 1140 × 720. Every screen in this document is built from the tokens below and can be re-themed by switching its mode.",
