                  "content": "•  Page: Alt+↑/↓ cycle · Ctrl+Shift+A alternatives · Ctrl+Shift+G AI · Ctrl+/ ghost · Ctrl+Shift+X stash · Ctrl+L Lab · Ctrl+. markers · Ctrl+Shift+M preview · Ctrl+K T theme · Ctrl+? cheat sheet.",
